rovider_none:"Abhi koi upstream provider nahi.",hisaab_honesty:"Nayatel ko May 2025\u2013Oct 2026 tak PKR 502,820 is register se pehle diye gaye \u2014 ye ledger kharch mein nahi, is liye kul munafa is se PKR 502,820 zyada nazar aata hai.",hisaab_duration_year:"{n} saal",hisaab_duration_month_one:"{n} mahina",hisaab_duration_month_many:"{n} mahine",hisaab_duration_day:"{n} din",prv_fb_heading:"First-bill preview",prv_fb_explainer:"Show the new customer this first bill before activation \u2014 installation fee, first-period charge and deposit \u2014 so nothing arrives as a surprise. This preview creates no bill; the first bill is only raised by the normal billing flow.",prv_fb_start_date:"Start date",prv_fb_first_period:"First period",prv_fb_mode_auto:"By start date (1st = full month, later = pro-rata)",prv_fb_full_month:"Full month",prv_fb_prorata:"Pro-rata",prv_fb_show:"Show preview",prv_pc_heading:"Package change preview",prv_pc_explainer:"Before agreeing a faster or cheaper package, show the customer what the next bill will actually be \u2014 current package, proposed package, monthly price difference, effective date, and the estimated next bill (full month, or pro-rata by the change date). This preview applies nothing; the change itself is still made through the profile Edit form, and a ready preview shown here is kept as a note on that change.",prv_pc_proposed_package:"Proposed package",prv_pc_effective_date:"Effective date",prv_pc_next_bill_month:"Next bill month",prv_pc_estimate:"Estimate",prv_pc_mode_auto:"By effective date (start = full month, inside = pro-rata)",prv_pc_no_package:"No catalogue package to preview.",prv_pc_option:"{label} \u2014 {amount} / month",prv_bc_heading:"Billing cycle",prv_bc_explainer:"Match the due date to the household's payday \u2014 a customer paid on the 15th should not always be late on a 5th due date. The next bill raised gets the new due date; every earlier bill keeps its old one.",prv_bc_due_day:"Due day of month",prv_bc_save:"Save billing cycle",prv_pch_heading:"Preferred payment channel",prv_pch_explainer:"Cash customers should be told to pay the collector, and wallet customers should be told the wallet route \u2014 not the other way round. Set the channel once and every reminder, escalation, confirmation and statement draft sent to this customer carries the matching instructions.",prv_pch_preferred_channel:"Preferred channel",prv_pch_not_set:"Not set (neutral instructions)",prv_pch_cash:"Cash via collector",prv_pch_wallet:"Easypaisa/wallet",prv_pch_save:"Save payment channel",prv_pch_remove:"Remove channel",prv_ql_heading:"Speed and service-quality log",prv_ql_explainer:'When a customer says "my internet is slow", record what was actually measured at that house and when \u2014 date, download/upload, and where it was measured \u2014 so the next visit argues from facts, not memory. This is a record only, not a live speed test and not a billing or package input; logging never changes any charge, bill, payment, or ticket.',prv_ql_record:"Record measurement",prv_ql_date:"Date",prv_ql_download:"Download (Mbps)",prv_ql_upload:"Upload (Mbps)",prv_ql_where:"Where measured",prv_ql_near_router:"Near the router",prv_ql_far_room:"Far room",prv_ql_other_location:"Other location",prv_ql_note:"Note",prv_ql_linked_ticket:"Linked ticket id",prv_ql_other_placeholder:"Optional, e.g. bedroom corner",prv_ql_optional:"Optional",prv_ql_not_recorded_msg:"Could not record: check the date, both speeds, and the location.",prv_ql_recorded_msg:"Measurement recorded.",prv_wd_heading:"Wada \u2014 promises to pay",prv_wd_aria:"Wada promises",prv_wd_promised_date:"Promised date",prv_wd_amount:"Amount promised (Rs, optional)",prv_wd_note:"Note (optional)",prv_wd_amount_ph:"e.g. 100",prv_wd_note_ph:"e.g. in next bill",prv_wd_add:"Add Wada",prv_wd_chip_29:"29th",prv_wd_chip_30:"30th",prv_wd_chip_31:"31st",prv_fb_no_preview:"No first-bill preview",prv_fb_summary_incomplete:"First-bill preview incomplete: {reasons}",prv